  "question": {
    "text": "If the radius of the circle passing through the origin and touching the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;units, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Family of circles touching the given line at the given point is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />It passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, hence <math><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />So, the equation of the circle is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Radius <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
    "image": null
  },
